On all three nodes
1. Update Rocky linux & Reboot
# dnf update -y

2. Install epel repo & then install KVM packages
# dnf install epel-release.noarch
# dnf install -y qemu-kvm libvirt virt-install

3. Install Centos Ceph-reef repo
# dnf install centos-release-ceph-reef
# dnf install cephadm podman ceph-common

4. Configure /etc/hosts
10.190.0.9 kvm-node1
10.190.0.10 kvm-node2
10.190.0.10 kvm-node3

5. Create cephadm with sudo user & configure ssh keybase login from all the three nodes
# adduser cephadm
# visudo

6. 
cephadm bootstrap --mon-ip 10.190.0.9 --ssh-user cephadm  --config initial-ceph.conf
